WEBVTT

00:00:04.637 --> 00:00:06.013
There it is!
就在这里!

00:00:06.097 --> 00:00:08.349
-South America?!
-JOHNNY: Oh, cool!
南美?!

00:00:08.432 --> 00:00:11.769
I was there once spelunking
with some Norwegian wrestlers.
我曾经和一些挪威摔跤手在那里探险.

00:00:11.852 --> 00:00:14.313
We can just pop down there
and get a new one!
我们可以去那里找一个新的!

00:00:14.397 --> 00:00:17.066
If it were but that simple, my friend.
如果是那么容易就好了,朋友.

00:00:17.149 --> 00:00:21.821
First, you must travel through
the treacherous jungle.
首先,你必须穿越险恶的丛林.

00:00:21.904 --> 00:00:24.407
Survival's doubtful.
能不能熬过是一个疑问.

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:26.867
Then down a perilous river...
然后沿着一条危险的河流.

00:00:26.951 --> 00:00:27.910
BOTH:
Whoa.
哇.

00:00:27.994 --> 00:00:31.539
...until you reach
the Cave of the Reflexión!
直到你到达反映山洞.

00:00:33.332 --> 00:00:36.836
Where entering is deadly
进入可能会致命...

00:00:36.919 --> 00:00:41.674
and escape impossible!
出来更是不可能.

00:00:41.757 --> 00:00:43.342
It... it...

00:00:43.426 --> 00:00:47.305
it cost me my right back wheel.
它令我失去了后右轮.

00:00:48.806 --> 00:00:52.393
Uh, sorry for your loss?
很抱歉对于你所失去的?

00:00:53.477 --> 00:00:54.687
(steady beeping)

00:00:54.770 --> 00:00:56.981
Well, happy hunting.
祝你们寻宝愉快!

00:00:57.064 --> 00:00:59.984
(groans) This is a disaster!
这是一个灾难!

00:01:00.067 --> 00:01:01.360
JOHNNY:
Don't worry, Drac.
别担心,德克拉.

00:01:01.444 --> 00:01:02.987
We'll get you back to your old self.
我们会令你还原的.

00:01:03.070 --> 00:01:04.739
But first, I better tell Mavis
we're going.
但是首先我最好告诉梅维斯我们要出发了.

00:01:04.822 --> 00:01:06.574
(stammers)
Oh, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no!
不.你不能告诉梅维丝.

00:01:06.657 --> 00:01:08.409
You can't tell Mavis!
不.你不能告诉梅维丝.

00:01:08.492 --> 00:01:09.910
Why not?
为什么不能?

00:01:09.994 --> 00:01:13.539
Uh, because, uh, you know, if you do,
如果你告诉她,她就要跟来

00:01:13.622 --> 00:01:15.916
then, uh, then she will
want to come with us,
如果你告诉她,她就要跟来

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:18.878
and-and I was thinking that this could be
我在想

00:01:18.961 --> 00:01:22.131
a-a father-son, uh, bonding type of thing.
这可以是我们父子增进感情的机会.

00:01:22.214 --> 00:01:23.299
Yes. (chuckles)
是的.你明白吗...

00:01:23.382 --> 00:01:26.218
You know, just the two of us?
只是我们俩?

00:01:26.302 --> 00:01:27.470
Really?
真的吗?太棒了!

00:01:27.553 --> 00:01:29.347
-Awesome!
-Hold up, hold up.
嘿,等一等.路途上将会有很多拥抱.

00:01:29.430 --> 00:01:31.307
There'll be plenty of hugs on the trip.
嘿,等一等.路途上将会有很多拥抱.

00:01:31.390 --> 00:01:33.059
All right, time to go.
好了.是时候出发了.不要浪费时间!

00:01:33.142 --> 00:01:34.643
Not a moment to waste!
好了.是时候出发了.不要浪费时间!

00:01:34.727 --> 00:01:36.437
(pants, grunts)

00:01:36.520 --> 00:01:37.772
Right.
对.

00:01:37.855 --> 00:01:39.940
Still human.
还是人类.

00:01:42.735 --> 00:01:45.154
FRANK: I-I don't know.
It took me by surprise.
我不知道.我被吓到了.这是一个进步.

00:01:45.237 --> 00:01:46.906
It's, uh, kind of an improvement.
我不知道.我被吓到了.这是一个进步.

00:01:46.989 --> 00:01:49.575
Right? I think Johnny looks
way better as a monster.
对吗?我想约翰尼变成怪物更好看.

00:01:49.658 --> 00:01:51.243
GRIFFIN:
Yeah, there's a good-looking guy in there.
里面是一个帅哥.

00:01:51.327 --> 00:01:53.704
Ooh, and the green
really brings out his eyes.
还有那绿色?真的突出了他的眼睛.

00:01:53.788 --> 00:01:55.373
-(phone chimes, vibrates)
-Hey, it's Drac.
嘿,这是德拉克.

00:01:55.456 --> 00:01:59.126
"Going to find crystal to fix ray
"去找水晶修复射线将我们还原."

00:01:59.210 --> 00:02:01.379
to turn us back to normal."
"去找水晶修复射线将我们还原."

00:02:01.462 --> 00:02:02.963
"Don't tell Mavis"?
"别告诉梅维丝"?

00:02:03.047 --> 00:02:04.924
(groans) Drac always does this.
德拉克时常这样做.我不喜欢夹在他和梅维丝之间.

00:02:05.007 --> 00:02:07.051
I hate getting caught
between him and Mavis.
德拉克时常这样做.我不喜欢夹在他和梅维丝之间.

00:02:07.134 --> 00:02:08.386
What should I write back?
我该回什么?

00:02:08.469 --> 00:02:12.348
How about, "No, we're not
covering for you anymore"?
不如写:"不!我们不会再替你隐瞒."

00:02:12.431 --> 00:02:13.808
GRIFFIN:
Yeah, "Now that you're human,
对."现在你是人类,你无能为力!"

00:02:13.891 --> 00:02:15.518
you can't do nothing about it."
对."现在你是人类,你无能为力!"

00:02:15.601 --> 00:02:18.312
"Go do your own dirty work
for a change, buster."
"自己动手做一次脏活,朋友!"

00:02:18.396 --> 00:02:20.398
Okay, got it. Send.
好,明白!发送!

00:02:20.481 --> 00:02:21.857
-What?! -What?!
-You actually sent that?!
什么?你真的发送了?

00:02:21.941 --> 00:02:24.360
Oh, man, we're in trouble now.
天啊,我们有麻烦了!

00:02:24.443 --> 00:02:26.028
Nah, I just sent him a gif.
不.我只是发送一个图像.

00:02:26.112 --> 00:02:28.114
(upbeat music playing)
不.我只是发送一个图像.

00:02:28.197 --> 00:02:29.407
(burbles)

00:02:29.490 --> 00:02:31.492
Oh, hey, Blobby, check it out.
嘿,果冻.你看.

00:02:32.993 --> 00:02:34.120
(Frank laughs)

00:02:34.203 --> 00:02:35.413
That's a nice one, Blobby.
这个好,果冻.

00:02:35.496 --> 00:02:36.872
GRIFFIN:
Hey, here's to Blobby.
嘿,这是敬果冻的.

00:02:36.956 --> 00:02:39.208
(burbling)

00:02:39.291 --> 00:02:41.877
-(startled burbling)
-No, Bl-- No, Blobby.
不,果冻,我只是说"这是敬一群伟大的人."

00:02:41.961 --> 00:02:44.713
I just said, "Here's a toast
to a bunch of great guys."
不,果冻,我只是说"这是敬一群伟大的人."

00:02:44.797 --> 00:02:46.382
What does he think I said?
他以为我说什么?

00:02:46.465 --> 00:02:47.633
(growls)

00:02:47.716 --> 00:02:48.926
Cheers!
干杯!

00:02:49.009 --> 00:02:50.678
(all gulping noisily)

00:02:55.349 --> 00:02:56.851
(all sigh)

00:02:56.934 --> 00:02:58.269
(stomach gurgles)

00:02:58.352 --> 00:03:00.062
Huh? Whoa!

00:03:00.146 --> 00:03:02.064
(groaning)

00:03:02.148 --> 00:03:04.525
(whimpering)
某些事情在发生!

00:03:04.608 --> 00:03:08.529
Something is happening.
某些事情在发生!

00:03:08.612 --> 00:03:10.364
Oh! (screams)

00:03:10.448 --> 00:03:12.366
Oh. (gasps, screams)
哇.

00:03:12.450 --> 00:03:14.285
Oh, no. No, nose, nose!
糟了.不!鼻子!

00:03:14.368 --> 00:03:16.287
Uh, wh... why?
为什么?我的缝线!啊!什么...?

00:03:16.370 --> 00:03:17.496
My stitches! Oh!
为什么?我的缝线!啊!什么...?

00:03:17.580 --> 00:03:19.582
What the-- (screams)
为什么?我的缝线!啊!什么...?

00:03:19.665 --> 00:03:21.208
What's going on?
发生什么事?

00:03:21.292 --> 00:03:23.335
Huh? (screams)

00:03:23.419 --> 00:03:25.254
(screams)

00:03:25.337 --> 00:03:26.338
What the...
什么...?

00:03:26.422 --> 00:03:28.591
(gasps)

00:03:28.674 --> 00:03:30.050
My fur!
我的毛!

00:03:30.134 --> 00:03:31.135
(screams)

00:03:31.218 --> 00:03:33.471
Oh, no, no. What's this, you guys?
糟了.这是什么,大伙们?

00:03:33.554 --> 00:03:35.556
Oh, I'm balding?
啊,我秃头了?

00:03:35.639 --> 00:03:36.640
-What's happening?
-What the...
发生什么事?

00:03:36.724 --> 00:03:38.767
(both screaming)

00:03:39.768 --> 00:03:41.687
BOTH:
Naked!
裸体!

00:03:41.770 --> 00:03:43.564
Huh? (squeals)

00:03:43.647 --> 00:03:46.108
(all screaming)

00:03:46.192 --> 00:03:47.318
FRANK:
Wow.
哇!

00:03:48.736 --> 00:03:50.946
-What's up, fellas?
-(camera clicks)
大家好吗?

00:03:51.030 --> 00:03:53.157
-Ooh.
-Oh, he got the worst of it.
啊,他最糟糕.

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:55.701
-(confused burbling)
-(stomach gurgling)
啊,他最糟糕.

00:03:55.784 --> 00:03:57.661
(burbling screams)

00:03:57.745 --> 00:04:00.122
ALL:
Huh? (gasping, shouting)

00:04:04.293 --> 00:04:06.587
(all screaming)

00:04:06.670 --> 00:04:08.672
(engine sputtering)

00:04:11.217 --> 00:04:13.219
(burbling)

00:04:15.221 --> 00:04:16.972
(grunts) Wow.
哇,以怪物飞行好多了.对吗,德拉克?

00:04:17.056 --> 00:04:19.099
Flying as a monster is so much better.
哇,以怪物飞行好多了.对吗,德拉克?

00:04:19.183 --> 00:04:20.184
Right, Drac?
哇,以怪物飞行好多了.对吗,德拉克?

00:04:20.267 --> 00:04:22.311
(hyperventilating)

00:04:23.521 --> 00:04:25.439
(high-pitched voice):
Feeling better?
感觉好些了吗?

00:04:25.523 --> 00:04:27.024
Nervous flier, huh?
紧张的乘客吗?

00:04:27.107 --> 00:04:28.859
(screams)

00:04:28.943 --> 00:04:31.320
How is this plane even in the sky?!
这架飞机如何飞上天空?

00:04:31.403 --> 00:04:32.613
What is that sound?
那是什么声音?你闻到烧焦味吗?

00:04:32.696 --> 00:04:33.822
Do you smell burning?
那是什么声音?你闻到烧焦味吗?

00:04:33.906 --> 00:04:36.450
Is that duct tape
holding the wing together?!
那是胶带贴住机翼吗?

00:04:38.077 --> 00:04:39.912
(screams)

00:04:39.995 --> 00:04:41.080
(static crackles over P.A.)
好了,各位!

00:04:41.163 --> 00:04:42.164
PILOT:
Okay, folks,
好了,各位!

00:04:42.248 --> 00:04:44.333
we've reached our cruising altitude.
我们已经到达巡航高度了.预计不会有乱流.

00:04:44.416 --> 00:04:46.168
We're not expecting any turbulence,
我们已经到达巡航高度了.预计不会有乱流.

00:04:46.252 --> 00:04:50.297
-so sit back, relax and enjoy the ride.
-(whimpering)
请坐下,放松和享受旅程.

00:04:56.345 --> 00:04:57.513
(sighs)

00:05:01.934 --> 00:05:04.228
(grunting)

00:05:10.067 --> 00:05:11.860
Whoa, oh, oh.

00:05:11.944 --> 00:05:12.945
(groaning)

00:05:13.028 --> 00:05:14.572
Uh, hey, Drac?
嘿,德拉克.我想你变回怪物了.

00:05:14.655 --> 00:05:16.657
I think you're turning back
into a monster.
嘿,德拉克.我想你变回怪物了.

00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:19.076
(stifled retch)
I got to get to the bathroom!
我必须去洗手间!

00:05:19.159 --> 00:05:21.537
(groaning)

00:05:21.620 --> 00:05:22.621
(confused grunt)

00:05:22.705 --> 00:05:25.124
Aw, are you feeling sick?
啊,你不舒服吗?

00:05:25.207 --> 00:05:26.834
Yes. (stifled retch)
是的.

00:05:26.917 --> 00:05:28.085
I just need to...
我只是要...

00:05:28.168 --> 00:05:30.296
-Try spinning!
-(groaning)
尝试旋转!

00:05:30.379 --> 00:05:32.673
Huh. Maybe some food
will settle your stomach.
也许吃些食物来安抚你的胃.

00:05:32.756 --> 00:05:34.216
(stifled retch)

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:36.719
No? Or maybe some fresh air, then.
不要吗?那就来一些新鲜空气吧.

00:05:36.802 --> 00:05:40.889
(screaming)

00:05:40.973 --> 00:05:42.433
He seems better.
他看来好多了.

00:05:42.516 --> 00:05:43.684
Yeah, thanks so much.
是的,非常谢谢你.

00:05:43.767 --> 00:05:45.811
It's my job.
这是我的工作.

00:05:45.894 --> 00:05:47.730
(screaming)

00:05:48.814 --> 00:05:50.774
-(knock on door)
-Dad?
爸.

00:05:50.858 --> 00:05:52.776
I really need to talk to you.
我真的必须和你谈.

00:05:52.860 --> 00:05:55.321
Dad, are you in here?
爸,你在里面吗?

00:05:56.405 --> 00:05:57.573
Dad?
爸?

00:05:57.656 --> 00:06:00.075
(sighs) Where is he?
他在哪里?

00:06:02.995 --> 00:06:04.997
♪ ♪
酒店 我 爸爸

